          reason: 'the pre-flight compaction + the turn answer settle',
        );
        io.sendLine('/exit');
        await run;
        await io.close();

        // The pre-flight pass ran (summarizer + its memory-extraction
        // rider); the turn itself is the LAST stream call — nothing fires
