  'ZERO LM calls; a dead summarizer degrades at the FIRST TURN\'s '
  'pre-flight — the local-trim valve caps it with a visible note and '
  'the request is still ≤ window',
  timeout: const Timeout(Duration(minutes: 5)),
  () async {
