            "switched to session "
            "'boot-cap-target'",
          ) &&
          !agent.isBusy,
      reason: 'the switch settles (terminal line after the async tail)',
    );
    // The lazy boot made no LM call AND kept the armed pass pending: the
    // visible deferred note is the boot's receipt (the pass is consumed
    // only where a compaction actually runs).
    expect(
      io.out.toString(),
      contains('compaction deferred to the first message'),
    );

    io.sendLine('go');
    await waitForIt(
      () =>
          io.out.toString().contains(
            'FINAL ANSWER on the compacted transcript',
