Why didn't the pre-flight fire? The pass must have been consumed somewhere between the boot peek and the 'go'. OR the pre-flight gate didn't see it pending. The probe earlier showed the boot's peek → overCap=true (the pass WAS pending at the boot). Between the boot and 'go': NOTHING but the note + replay... EXCEPT — the ABORT flag! At 'go': `_beginUserPrompt` — wait, let me re-check the ORDER in `_beginUserPrompt`:

